From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Danil Somsikov <dsv@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 01:15:46 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 43/48] [DevTools] Enforce local-frontend embedder checks in
 dispatcher

Remote frontends (devtools://devtools/remote/) should not access
profile DevTools settings or account info. Enforce local-frontend
restrictions in DevToolsEmbedderMessageDispatcher (requiring an
explicit AllowedFrontend argument) and restrict the preference and
sync-info handlers accordingly. Remote frontends now get empty
settings and will not persist them across sessions.

Bug: 553145250
Change-Id: Ic6813a080e06e3b86203e0141800a40a2c78ae3c
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8540814
Reviewed-by: Antonio Sartori <antoniosartori@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Andrey Kosyakov <caseq@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Danil Somsikov <dsv@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1716597}
(cherry picked from commit 200411e47458b88230a287b800d7b176fed79eef)
